Business Owner
You own a business or control it from behind the
scenes. Either way, it provides staff and customers
available to feed from at your convenience. You most
likely had a business in real life or worked for one in a
position giving you knowledge day to day operations.
■ Add a specialty: Persuasion (Deals) or Finance
